oofem.out
con2dpm for triaxial compression: 30.1 MPa confinement
NonLinearStatic nmsteps 2 nsteps 1 contextOutputStep 1000 smtype 1
nsteps 20 rtolv 1.e-4 stiffMode 2  manrmsteps 1  maxiter 2000 controllmode 1 minsteplength 1.e-4
nsteps 200 rtolv 1.e-4 maxiter 2000 controllmode 1 refloadmode 0 minsteplength 1.e-3 ddm 2 3 2 ddv 1 -1.0e-4 ddltf 3 stiffmode 1
#
domain 3d
#
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
#
ndofman 4 nelem 1 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 4 nic 0 nltf 3
node 1 coords 3 0. 0. 0. bc 3 1 1 1
node 2 coords 3 1. 0. 0. bc 3 0 1 1 load 1 4
node 3 coords 3 0. 1. 0. bc 3 0 0 1 load 1 2
node 4 coords 3 0. 0. 1. bc 3 1 1 0 load 1 3
#
ltrspace 1 nodes 4 1 2 3 4 mat 1 crossSect 1
#
SimpleCS 1
#
con2dpm 1 d 0 E 30.e9 n 0.15 talpha 0. wf 9.3755e-5 fc 47.4e6 ft 4.74e6 hp 0.01 asoft 15. helem 0.1
#
BoundaryCondition  1 loadTimeFunction 1 prescribedvalue 0.0
NodalLoad 2 loadTimeFunction 2 Components 3 0. 0. 0.
NodalLoad 3 loadTimeFunction 2 Components 3 0.  0. -0.2508e6
NodalLoad 4 loadTimeFunction 2 Components 3 -0.2508e6 0. 0.
#
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.
PiecewiseLinFunction 2 nPoints 4 t 4  0. 19.1 19.2 220. f(t) 4 1. 1. 0. 0.
PiecewiseLinFunction 3 nPoints 4 t 4  0. 0.1 0.2 220. f(t) 4 0. 0. 0. 480.
#
#%BEGIN_CHECK%
#ELEMENT number 1 gp 1 record 0 keyword strains component 2
#ELEMENT number 1 gp 1 record 0 keyword strains component 3
#ELEMENT number 1 gp 1 record 1 keyword stresses component 2
#TIME
#%END_CHECK%
